{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:965","content":{"id":965,"title":"图片与图册","content":[{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"cf63f6c4-7503-49d8-86e5-8ef7bf4eaf0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e95b7245-86f7-4deb-81c4-2ee19e53b71c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上传图片之前，强烈建议打开设置中压缩图片的开关，可以减小 90% 的图片体积大小而不影响视觉效果"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0f3d0455-c2ef-4f37-a63f-7655a7abec95.webp","uuid":"cbb49010-b0d5-4f84-ad07-85e2a074bcfa","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0f3d0455-c2ef-4f37-a63f-7655a7abec95.webp","width":720,"collabId":"6fb82531-1339-4939-85d7-562e85bcbe45","naturalWidth":3456,"naturalHeight":2168,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cbc8614b-134a-45cb-aaa1-d94ab88a8846","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们支持多种上传图片的方式，包括："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"897e43e1-b410-4130-a5de-92180a25c6c6","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"eae8b67e-94e7-4e99-a10c-55e1066b33a4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f41a8043-dc6b-4854-acda-b22bbc983734","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AI 生成"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a19e46b0-a246-480f-a5c5-c1bd4a3a5614","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持通过 GPT Image 2 来生成和编辑图片，需要在设置的「图片生成」Tab 下进行配置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9a2d756a-811d-43a4-84a1-f818f7fe3cc1.webp","uuid":"5ad91d07-57f4-4d30-b13e-13eec3d339d2","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9a2d756a-811d-43a4-84a1-f818f7fe3cc1.webp","width":720,"collabId":"6ebdd0c0-db8b-452d-a05e-fa31a4abcc23","naturalWidth":3456,"naturalHeight":2168,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f73d30fe-cdea-4091-9d6b-2f8687c96947","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5be51b1c-c91b-4246-9fef-25a0dc5b8ab0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地图片，直接打开文件选择器，选择电脑上本地的文件"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4c4f2d68-d6d1-4037-9c81-9ad6f41da428","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6695e6fc-2c93-45c0-ad79-2efd33427a92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络地址，可以直接粘贴复制的网页链接（这个图片必须可以访问，而且没有权限设置，否则下载不下来）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"184f2ca3-cb59-4e5d-996a-334690d0562d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b01983bd-5cc1-4a89-b7ff-f8d4854176ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"资源库，资源库中保存了所有之前上传过的图片，如果发现图片之前已经在资源库中，可以直接使用资源库中的地址"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"62c5a26d-eb1e-4c8e-8471-556f35f15a8d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"47adcd42-f93c-4cb6-ab44-94322e8b0bbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"粘贴，复制的电脑上或者网页上的图片可以直接粘贴"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"c4ea7c80-407e-4077-b0fe-c85a310425af","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8b3ce602-31f6-4292-822c-e8bc64c86cd9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"拖拽，可以直接把电脑上的图片拖拽到文档中，会自动插入到拖拽的位置"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cec2ef15-0bfc-4633-8593-f775ac04b5fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们还提供一些对图片样式的两个外观设置，分别是圆角和阴影，在外观设置中可以看到"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_deae3df4-5594-43fa-bd0d-e17699c2e9e9.webp","uuid":"f42882aa-caba-4400-835f-5065f7032fdd","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_deae3df4-5594-43fa-bd0d-e17699c2e9e9.webp","width":720,"collabId":"59ee67df-db4a-47fe-b3f9-9170c2fa1999","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"header","disableDrag":false,"level":2,"collabId":"0398a5da-3545-4798-9fb7-8b5b96e1f3eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图册"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4faaef19-2f91-402e-b6ba-47e395801e5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经常有一些场景需要插入一大批图片的情况，需要作为一个整理看待，我们提供图册来满足这一目的，可以对图片集合进行简单的排版。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"34d3ea58-1729-4cc3-9e90-6c966c9b92ed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们支持三种图片排版，分别是："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"9f6ad9b1-08c8-4b2b-b5ec-a53313b895ed","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"da1817af-7456-402a-9676-2edf6aab2a2d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ac559ee7-25a0-4972-893c-5a2b700dc5a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"横向，所有在一行的图片保持相同的高度"}]},{"type":"image-gallery","mode":1,"images":[{"id":"4d2c3599-12ae-4240-8795-fab22bd90f05","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-nr1vg1_4c46af07-f44a-4ee9-8b64-9d93bd132ae5.webp"},{"id":"e2bbef2d-f013-476f-ae94-7254ec182898","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-mlwg7k_f7b1eeb7-2dc1-414a-8fd4-47deb0d83f3b.webp","width":3610,"height":1700},{"id":"5bfdce2b-1222-4630-b7aa-2bed58db7902","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-yqqvv7_ac13fbd0-4d6a-4fb1-963f-5463188b0de9.webp","width":3840,"height":2044},{"id":"8f774790-19d9-4c0c-9488-ba9f32a95338","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-powrye_50584dc9-497b-4dbf-bcbf-7e0b1552e47b.webp","width":3840,"height":2160},{"id":"c9f34d2f-3905-4a00-b55a-cfb5fd9a6e20","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-jekl2q_98e991d2-f66f-44c0-aeb8-a6b144b21658.webp"}],"height":150,"wider":false,"columnCount":3,"margins":8,"lastRow":"nojustify","collabId":"e1358c9e-eb5d-4949-9a65-a97ec5887968","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2f1aa9f5-4537-46d3-a8b9-e2682ad9f720","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a4c9dbe8-f815-42e9-919b-9d13e07fa164","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"纵向，图片分为占据相同宽度的多列"}]